     This is discussed in one of the numbered notes in source file
sys/unix/Install.unx.  You've compiled for terminfo but linked with
termcap.  You don't need to build any library, you need to change
one of the settings in include/unixconf.h to match the library you
intend to link with, and then rebuild nethack.  In some cases (I've
no idea about OSX though), you could change the library setting
in src/Makefile and just relink instead.


